      "value": "@{623b42220cd35c52996e660d|full_name}: Yeah, that avatar is behaving exactly as the documentation describes - toggles on the Gesture layer are not being copied over. I don't see any particularly recent changes to this part of the code either, so if this has worked before it would have been undefined behaviour already.\n\nSince the new one works as intended, I don't think there's more for us to do here? The docs are accurate to what is happening in the client now, and the behaviour of only copying the FX layer and humanoid transforms is an optimization that we will not change.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
