      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Then I guess this optimization of only copying the FX only started working correctly some patches ago. Since I have had the <fish>< toggle in Gesture layer since the start of 2023 and it did work before. Also having that toggle in Gesture layer currently only impact local mirror and camera. Any remote user will see them in mirror and camera as normal.\n\nLooking at the documentation, it does look like the situation currently is how it should be. I guess this can be marked as resolve if this is the case.",
